  "title": "Nekomonogatari (Kuro): Tsubasa Family",
  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 102261 and TMDB show 46195. AniDB episode 1 \"TV Special\" (the anime \"猫物語(黒) つばさファミリー\") is TMDB S0E6 \"猫物語（黒） つばさファミリー 其ノ壹\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: Tsubasa Family (1)) + TMDB S0E7 \"猫物語（黒） つばさファミリー 其ノ貳\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: Tsubasa Family (2)) + TMDB S0E8 \"猫物語（黒） つばさファミリー 其ノ參\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: Tsubasa Family (3)) + TMDB S0E9 \"猫物語（黒） つばさファミリー 其ノ肆\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: Tsubasa Family (4)); AniDB episode 2-5 (\"Part 1 of 4\" (the anime \"猫物語(黒) つばさファミリー\") to \"Part 4 of 4\" (the anime \"猫物語(黒) つばさファミリー\")) are TMDB S0E6 \"猫物語（黒） つばさファミリー 其ノ壹\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: Tsubasa Family (1)) to TMDB S0E9 \"猫物語（黒） つばさファミリー 其ノ肆\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: Tsubasa Family (4)); AniDB S1 \"Bakemonogatari Recap\" is TMDB S0E5 \"阿良々木暦と、怪異に行き遭った少女たちの物語\" (Nekomonogatari Kuro: The Story of Araragi Koyomi and the girls who encountered oddities) and has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E1 is \"Episode 5.5 (Recap)\", another item); AniDB S2-S3 (\"Episode S2\" to \"Episode S3\") have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items) and no TMDB episode (their defaults are other items). S1, a two-minute Bakemonogatari recap, is TMDB's only short recap of that kind (S0E5, 2 minutes).",
